Small strain plasticity with isotropic and kinematic hardening.

# Arguments
- `Hiso`, `Hkine`: isotropic and kinematic hardening moduli
- `yield`: initial yield stress
- `plasticityType`: the hardening law, as a MUESLI keyword
"""
